==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-fin-pro|fi}} {{recons|pelto|lang=fiu-fin-pro}}, a loan from {{etyl|gem-pro|fi}} {{recons|felþu|lang=gem-pro}} (see English {{term|field}}). Cognate with Estonian and Livonian {{term|põld|lang=et}}, Veps {{term|püud|lang=vep}}, Votic {{term|põlto|lang=vot}}.

